        "code": { "language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "### High-sensitivity diagnostics\n\nContent panels remain empty unless `AI_OBSERVABILITY_CAPTURE_CONTENT=true` is set on **luna-agent**. Captured prompts, replies, reasoning summaries, tool arguments and results are redacted and capped at 32 KiB per field, but may still contain private business data. Use a short retention period and disable the switch after troubleshooting.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.6.0",
      "title": "Capture status and risk",
      "type": "text"
    },
